      "id": "5k9xere",
      "type": "list",
      "items": [
        "<img></img>Narmada Main Canal: Longest irrigation canal in India emerging from Sardar Sarovar Dam. The canal is approximately 458 km long (main canal).",
        "Sujalam Sufalam Canal: Part of Gujarat's water grid connecting Narmada waters to North Gujarat.",
        "Ukai Reservoir: Largest reservoir in Gujarat on Tapi River."
      ]
